org.nem.nis.controller.AccountController.accountLock Locks an account from harvesting. <pre><code>inline void org::nem::nis::controller::AccountController::accountLock (
    @Valid @RequestBody final PrivateKey privateKey
) 
</code></pre> <p>Parameters:</p> <ul> <li><code>privateKey</code> The private key of the account to lock. </li> </ul>

org.nem.nis.controller.AccountController.accountUnlock Unlocks an account for harvesting. <pre><code>inline void org::nem::nis::controller::AccountController::accountUnlock (
    @Valid @RequestBody final PrivateKey privateKey
) 
</code></pre> <p>Parameters:</p> <ul> <li><code>privateKey</code> The private key of the account to unlock. </li> </ul>

org.nem.nis.controller.AccountController.isAccountUnlocked Checks if the given account is unlocked. <pre><code>inline String org::nem::nis::controller::AccountController::isAccountUnlocked (
    @RequestBody final Address address
) 
</code></pre> <p>Parameters:</p> <ul> <li><code>address</code> The address of the account to check. </li> </ul> <p>Returns:</p> <p>"ok" if account is unlocked. </p>

org.nem.nis.controller.AccountController.isAccountUnlocked Checks if the given account is unlocked. <pre><code>inline String org::nem::nis::controller::AccountController::isAccountUnlocked (
    @Valid @RequestBody final PrivateKey privateKey
) 
</code></pre> <p>Parameters:</p> <ul> <li><code>privateKey</code> The private key of the account to check. </li> </ul> <p>Returns:</p> <p>"ok" if account is unlocked. </p>

