</code></pre> <p>Parameters:</p> <ul> <li><code>height</code> The height. </li> </ul> <p>Returns:</p> <p>The matching block. </p>

org.nem.nis.controller.BlockController.blockAt Gets a block with the specified height. <pre><code>inline AuthenticatedResponse &lt; Block &gt; org::nem::nis::controller::BlockController::blockAt (
    @RequestBody final AuthenticatedBlockHeightRequest request
